# Minimal agent profile (PROFILE=minimal): lean headless box for AI agents.
# Shell + core dev toolchain only — no GUI, no desktop/locale/IME, no GUI
# editors (VSCodium/Cursor are skipped in step 20 too; Docker is kept there).
# Hand-curated (unlike apt.list, which is the full showmanual export); step 10
# still applies its boot/kernel/third-party filters on top, harmlessly.
build-essential
ca-certificates
curl
git
gpg
# NOT kitty itself (this box has no GUI) — just its terminfo entry, 114 kB.
# A headless box exists to be SSH'd INTO, and kitty sets TERM=xterm-kitty; a
# remote without the entry answers every ncurses tool with "unknown terminal
# type xterm-kitty" (less, vim, clear, and p10k's own probing). Found live on
# the TODO K cloud-init box, 2026-09-24: local VMs never showed it because
# they install kitty, whose bundle carries the terminfo with it.
kitty-terminfo
tmux
wget
zsh
zsh-autosuggestions
zsh-syntax-highlighting
